```

with imports `stopRequested` from "./watch_for_stop.ts". Good.

And in watch_for_stop.test.ts, keep existing + maybe add the prose case. I'll add one line test to pin the rule generally:

```ts
  // The rule is about whose words the tag is in, not about the body quoting anybody: a
